A program with no plan checks every pair of prices once:

```python
for i in range(n):
    for j in range(i + 1, n):
        if nums[i] + nums[j] == target:
            return (i, j)
```

This version stores each price before checking for its complement.

```python
def two_sum(nums, target):
    seen = {}
    for i, x in enumerate(nums):
        seen[x] = i
        if target - x in seen:
            return (seen[target - x], i)
    return None
```

